[00:22.75]Stop the fire
[00:25.50]A mockingbird sings
[00:27.19]My name, laughing, calling me
[00:30.57]Who’s the liar?
[00:33.33]Maybe you’re in my bones, my blood
[00:37.74] 
[00:38.04]Take it all
[00:40.67]Filling me up, I’m empty
[00:43.73]Heartbeats
[00:44.63]Counting down, if I could stop the clock, you’d win
[00:54.46] 
[00:54.76]So whisper the names of your enemies
[00:58.60] 
[00:58.90]There’s a darker cloud
[01:00.19]Than what you left inside
[01:02.18]Growing like the winter wind
[01:05.06]I can bear your weight
[01:06.41]Your words and selfish pride
[01:08.21]You will not escape this sin
[01:11.46] 
[01:11.76]This is my revenge
[01:13.03]I’ll take us to the end
[01:14.98]You can watch beneath my skin
[01:17.89]Fear is just a smokescreen, heat is still my friend
[01:21.08]I will use the burn to win
[01:29.35] 
